  "draft_py": "# Lotus Field. Kept from the compiler: Hexproof (keyword) and \"This land enters tapped.\" (EtBState).\n# 3. \"When this land enters, sacrifice two lands.\" -- Crypt Lurker's SACRIFICE (B2a-crypt-lurker)\n#    over lands you control, count 2, mandatory.\netb_sac = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=ZoneChangeEvent(\n        from_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.ANY, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),\n        to_zone=Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        subject=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n    ),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=A(Verb.SACRIFICE, {\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QConst(value=2),\n            mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n            filter=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Land'),\n            )),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n)\n# 4. \"{T}: Add three mana of any one color.\" -- parse \"{T}: Add two mana of any one color.\"\n#    (frame B13-activated+B5a-add-any-color) with amount 3.\nmana = ActivatedAbility(\n    cost=Cost(parts=(CostTap(),)),\n    effect=A(Verb.ADD_MANA, {'amount': QConst(value=3), 'color': 'ANY', 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n)\nabilities = [*compiled, etb_sac, mana]\n",
